abstract: >-
  Leakage-checked comparison of sentiment lexicons, TF-IDF classifiers, BERT-base and the domain-pretrained
  FinBERT-MLM on Financial PhraseBank and the external SEntFiN 1.0 headlines, with a phenomenon-tagged
  diagnostic set and paired statistical tests. Course project, Essentials in Text and Speech Processing,
  University of Zurich.
